          "current_body_hex": "536f7272792c206275742e2e2e0a2049276d207374696c6c20747279696e6720746f20666967757265206f7574200a2077686174277320676f696e67206f6e2e20",
          "Japanese": "えーっと、…ごめんね。　あの\n事態がよく呑み込めないんだけど…",
          "current_English": "Sorry, but...\n I'm still trying to figure out \n what's going on. "
