          "source_body_hex": "82b182ea82c582a282a282cc81490a82c582cb814282b182cc82a082bd82e882cd814182a082bd82b582bd82bf0a8341815b8353836283678fa489ef82cc93ea92a382e882c882ed82af82e60a95aa82a982e98148",
          "current_body_hex": "49276d20646f696e672066696e652120416e797761792c0a2074686573652077617465727320617265204172676f7420436f6d70616e79200a207465727269746f72792e20476f742069743f20",
          "Japanese": "これでいいの！\nでね。このあたりは、あたしたち\nアーゴット商会の縄張りなわけよ\n分かる？",
          "current_English": "I'm doing fine! Anyway,\n these waters are Argot Company \n territory. Got it? "
        },
        {
