          "current_body_hex": "497320746869732067757920666f72207265616c3f0a204973206865207265616c6c7920616e2061646d6972616c3f",
          "Japanese": "ちょっとー。この人、だいじょーぶ？\nねえねえ、ホントに提督さんなのぉ？",
          "current_English": "Is this guy for real?\n Is he really an admiral?"
        },
