          "current_body_hex": "42757420796f75207365656d20646563656e742e200a20416c6c2072696768742c206c6574206d65206578706c61696e2e20",
          "Japanese": "でも、どうやら悪い人間じゃない\nみたいね。いいわ\nあたしが状況を説明してあげる",
          "current_English": "But you seem decent. \n All right, let me explain. "
        },
        {
