          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "83688343836382cc95fb82cd8141836e8393835593af96bf82cc0a837d838b836583428393814583568385837083438384815b82aa0a82c882f182c682a990d882e890b782e882b582c482e982c182c48ab482b6",
          "current_body_hex": "4f76657220696e204765726d616e792c204d617274696e20537065796572200a206f66207468652048616e736561746963204c6561677565206973206b656570696e67200a207468696e67732072756e6e696e672e20536f6d65686f772e",
          "Japanese": "ドイツの方は、ハンザ同盟の\nマルティン・シュパイヤーが\nなんとか切り盛りしてるって感じ",
          "current_English": "Over in Germany, Martin Speyer \n of the Hanseatic League is keeping \n things running. Somehow."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 1726,
          "current_command_offset": 1570,
          "source_offset": 1731,
          "current_offset": 1575,
          "source_record_index": 183,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82c5814191bc82cc926e88e682cd82be82a282bd82a20a82a082bd82b582f182c682b182aa814182b182ea82a982e78351836283670a82b582bd82a282c8815b82c182c48e7682c182c482e982ed82af82e6",
          "current_body_hex": "417320666f722074686520726573742c20776527726520686f70696e670a20746f20636c61696d206d6f7374206f66206974206f757273656c7665732e20",
          "Japanese": "で、他の地域はだいたい\nあたしんとこが、これからゲット\nしたいなーって思ってるわけよ",
          "current_English": "As for the rest, we're hoping\n to claim most of it ourselves. "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 1816,
          "current_command_offset": 1640,
          "source_offset": 1821,
          "current_offset": 1645,
          "source_record_index": 187,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82c882e982d982c7814282c582e08141838a838b82b382f10a8a5882c68c5f96f182b782ea82ce8fa4948482cd0a8cf695bd82c882f182b682e182c882a282cc8148",
          "current_body_hex": "49207365652e20427574204c696c2c206f6e636520796f75207369676e0a20612074726164696e6720636f6e74726163742077697468206120746f776e2c0a2069736e2774207472616465206661697220666f722065766572796f6e653f",
          "Japanese": "なるほど。でも、リルさん\n街と契約すれば商売は\n公平なんじゃないの？",
          "current_English": "I see. But Lil, once you sign\n a trading contract with a town,\n isn't trade fair for everyone?"
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 1890,
          "current_command_offset": 1742,
          "source_offset": 1895,
          "current_offset": 1747,
          "source_record_index": 192,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82bb82f182c882b182c695aa82a982c182c482e982ed814282be82a982e782cb0a82b582ce82e782ad82cc8ad4814182d982c182c682a282c482d982b582a282c8815b0a82c182c482b182c682c882cc",
          "current_body_hex": "49206b6e6f772074686174212049276d20736179696e6720492764206c696b65200a20796f7520746f206c6561766520757320616c6f6e6520666f722061207768696c652e20",
          "Japanese": "そんなこと分かってるわ。だからね\nしばらくの間、ほっといてほしいなー\nってことなの",
          "current_English": "I know that! I'm saying I'd like \n you to leave us alone for a while. "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 1978,
          "current_command_offset": 1820,
          "source_offset": 1983,
          "current_offset": 1825,
          "source_record_index": 196,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 5,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82b882a282d482f182c68141928e82cc82a282a2986282be82c88148",
          "current_body_hex": "486f7720636f6e76656e69656e7420666f7220796f752e20",
          "Japanese": "ずいぶんと、虫のいい話だな？",
          "current_English": "How convenient for you. "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2014,
          "current_command_offset": 1852,
          "source_offset": 2019,
          "current_offset": 1857,
          "source_record_index": 200,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82a4815b82f1814182bb82ea82cd82bf82e582c182c68163",
          "current_body_hex": "57656c6c2c207468617427732061206c6974746c652e2e2e",
          "Japanese": "うーん、それはちょっと…",
          "current_English": "Well, that's a little..."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2046,
          "current_command_offset": 1884,
          "source_offset": 2051,
          "current_offset": 1889,
          "source_record_index": 205,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82a082f182bd82bd82bf82c182c488ea899e0a90a28a4582f082cb82e782c182c482e982f182b682e182c882a282cc8148",
          "current_body_hex": "4172656e277420796f7520747279696e6720746f2074616b65206f6e200a207468652077686f6c6520776f726c643f",
          "Japanese": "あんたたちって一応\n世界をねらってるんじゃないの？",
          "current_English": "Aren't you trying to take on \n the whole world?"
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2102,
          "current_command_offset": 1938,
          "source_offset": 2107,
          "current_offset": 1943,
          "source_record_index": 208,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82a482f1814282bb82a482be82e6",
          "current_body_hex": "5965732e205765206172652e",
          "Japanese": "うん。そうだよ",
          "current_English": "Yes. We are."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2124,
          "current_command_offset": 1958,
          "source_offset": 2129,
          "current_offset": 1963,
          "source_record_index": 213,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82c182c482e082a4814197cd94b282af82e982ed82cb815b",
          "current_body_hex": "5567682e20596f75207265616c6c792074616b65200a207468652077696e64206f7574206f66206d79207361696c732e",
          "Japanese": "ってもう、力抜けるわねー",
          "current_English": "Ugh. You really take \n the wind out of my sails."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2176,
          "current_command_offset": 2034,
          "source_offset": 2181,
          "current_offset": 2039,
          "source_record_index": 225,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 4,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82bb82e882e182a0814196da955782cd82a082e882dc82b782e6",
          "current_body_hex": "576520646f2068617665206120676f616c2e",
          "Japanese": "そりゃあ、目標はありますよ",
          "current_English": "We do have a goal."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2226,
          "current_command_offset": 2076,
          "source_offset": 2231,
          "current_offset": 2081,
          "source_record_index": 238,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82c882e782cb81480a83418374838a834a82c682a982b3814190bc82cc905691e597a482c98cfc82a982a40a82c682a982a082e982c582b582e58148",
          "current_body_hex": "5468656e20776879206e6f74206865616420666f72204166726963612c0a206f72207361696c207765737420746f20746865204e657720576f726c643f20",
          "Japanese": "ならね？\nアフリカとかさ、西の新大陸に向かう\nとかあるでしょ？",
          "current_English": "Then why not head for Africa,\n or sail west to the New World? "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2298,
          "current_command_offset": 2150,
          "source_offset": 2303,
          "current_offset": 2155,
          "source_record_index": 244,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82c882e782cb8148814090a28a4582cd8d4c82a282b682e182c882a281490a91bc82c982e096da82f08cfc82af82c882ab82e182cb8149814981400a90bc82cc905691e597a482c682a98141938c82cc89ca82c482cc93e482f00a89f082ad82c682a9814182a082e982c582b582e581498148",
          "current_body_hex": "4974277320612062696720776f726c64210a204c6f6f6b20706173742074686973207365612e205361696c20776573740a20746f20746865204e657720576f726c64206f7220676f20756e726176656c200a20746865206d7973746572696573206f662074686520666172206561737421",
          "Japanese": "ならね？　世界は広いじゃない！\n他にも目を向けなきゃね！！　\n西の新大陸とか、東の果ての謎を\n解くとか、あるでしょ！？",
          "current_English": "It's a big world!\n Look past this sea. Sail west\n to the New World or go unravel \n the mysteries of the far east!"
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2424,
          "current_command_offset": 2274,
          "source_offset": 2429,
          "current_offset": 2279,
          "source_record_index": 250,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82d3815b82f1814282bb82a482a282a48d6c82a695fb82e082a082e982e682cb",
          "current_body_hex": "486d2e20546861742773206f6e652077617920746f206c6f6f6b2061742069742e20",
          "Japanese": "ふーん。そういう考え方もあるよね",
          "current_English": "Hm. That's one way to look at it. "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2464,
          "current_command_offset": 2316,
          "source_offset": 2469,
          "current_offset": 2321,
          "source_record_index": 255,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82be82a982e7814182b582ce82e782ad82cd82cb0a82a082bd82b582f182c682b182c98ee882f08f6f82b382c882a282c582c182c40a8cbe82c182c482f182cc",
          "current_body_hex": "536f2c2073746179206f7574206f66206f75722077617920666f722061207768696c652e",
          "Japanese": "だから、しばらくはね\nあたしんとこに手を出さないでって\n言ってんの",
          "current_English": "So, stay out of our way for a while."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2536,
          "current_command_offset": 2360,
          "source_offset": 2541,
          "current_offset": 2365,
          "source_record_index": 259,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "905e82c18cfc8f9f958982b782e982c182c482e482a482c882e70a986282cd95ca82be82af82c7814182bb82cc82c682ab82cd0a82b182c182bf82be82c182c48d6c82a682aa0a82a082e882dc82b782a982e782cb814295aa82a982c182bd82a982c88148",
          "current_body_hex": "496620796f752077616e7420746f2074616b65207573206f6e2c200a2074686174277320616e6f746865722073746f72792e20576527766520676f740a20706c616e73206f66206f7572206f776e2e20476f742069743f",
          "Japanese": "真っ向勝負するってゆうなら\n話は別だけど、そのときは\nこっちだって考えが\nありますからね。分かったかな？",
          "current_English": "If you want to take us on, \n that's another story. We've got\n plans of our own. Got it?"
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2644,
          "current_command_offset": 2454,
          "source_offset": 2649,
          "current_offset": 2459,
          "source_record_index": 262,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 9,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82bf82e5814182bf82e582c182c6838a838b82a38163",
          "current_body_hex": "572d776169742c204c696c2e2e2e",
          "Japanese": "ちょ、ちょっとリルぅ…",
          "current_English": "W-wait, Lil..."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2674,
          "current_command_offset": 2476,
          "source_offset": 2679,
          "current_offset": 2481,
          "source_record_index": 266,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82a682a6814282c882f182c682c882ad814282bb82ea82c182c40a82c282dc82e88141966c82bd82bf82c68ba692e882f08c8b82d182bd82a20a82c182c482b182c6816382be82e682cb8148",
          "current_body_hex": "4d6f7265206f72206c6573732e20596f752772652061736b696e67207573200a20746f20666f726d206120706163742c206172656e277420796f753f",
          "Japanese": "ええ。なんとなく。それって\nつまり、僕たちと協定を結びたい\nってこと…だよね？",
          "current_English": "More or less. You're asking us \n to form a pact, aren't you?"
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2758,
          "current_command_offset": 2544,
          "source_offset": 2763,
          "current_offset": 2549,
          "source_record_index": 271,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82c8814189bd82e6814295cf82c882c682b182eb82cd897382a282ed82cb0a82bb82cc8cbe82a295fb82be82c6814182b182c182bf82aa89ba8ee882c98f6f82c482e90a82dd82bd82a282b682e182c882a282cc",
          "current_body_hex": "572d776861743f20486f77276420796f75207069636b207570206f6e20746861743f200a20596f75206d616b6520697420736f756e64206c696b65207765277265200a20746865206f6e65732061736b696e6720666f722061206661766f722e",
          "Japanese": "な、何よ。変なところは鋭いわね\nその言い方だと、こっちが下手に出てる\nみたいじゃないの",
          "current_English": "W-what? How'd you pick up on that? \n You make it sound like we're \n the ones asking for a favor."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2850,
          "current_command_offset": 2648,
          "source_offset": 2855,
          "current_offset": 2653,
          "source_record_index": 275,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82d582c10a958982af82b88c9982a282c882f182be82cb",
          "current_body_hex": "4865682e20596f752068617465206c6f73696e672c20646f6e277420796f753f20",
          "Japanese": "ぷっ\n負けず嫌いなんだね",
          "current_English": "Heh. You hate losing, don't you? "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2880,
          "current_command_offset": 2688,
          "source_offset": 2885,
          "current_offset": 2693,
          "source_record_index": 279,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82bf82e582c182c6815b8142836f834a82c982b582c482f182cc8148",
          "current_body_hex": "486579212041726520796f75206d616b696e672066756e206f66206d653f",
          "Japanese": "ちょっとー。バカにしてんの？",
          "current_English": "Hey! Are you making fun of me?"
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2916,
          "current_command_offset": 2726,
          "source_offset": 2921,
          "current_offset": 2731,
          "source_record_index": 283,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82a482a482f1814182c682f182c582e082c882a282c582b782e6",
          "current_body_hex": "4e6f2c206e6f7420617420616c6c2e20",
          "Japanese": "ううん、とんでもないですよ",
          "current_English": "No, not at all. "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 2970,
          "current_command_offset": 2770,
          "source_offset": 2975,
          "current_offset": 2775,
          "source_record_index": 296,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 8,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82ad82b782ad82b78163",
          "current_body_hex": "486568206865682e2e2e",
          "Japanese": "くすくす…",
          "current_English": "Heh heh..."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 3012,
          "current_command_offset": 2812,
          "source_offset": 3017,
          "current_offset": 2817,
          "source_record_index": 311,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 6,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82e282ea82e282ea82b682e182c80a464982e2814282b182e882e10a91bc82cc8a4388e682d68d7382c182c489d282ae82d982a482aa0a93be8df482a982e082b582ea82f182cc82a4",
          "current_body_hex": "476f6f642067726965662c2046492e0a205765206d6967687420626520626574746572206f6666200a206d616b696e67206d6f6e657920696e206f74686572207761746572732e",
          "Japanese": "やれやれじゃな\nFIや。こりゃ\n他の海域へ行って稼ぐほうが\n得策かもしれんのう",
          "current_English": "Good grief, FI.\n We might be better off \n making money in other waters."
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 3124,
          "current_command_offset": 2922,
          "source_offset": 3129,
          "current_offset": 2927,
          "source_record_index": 328,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82a082f182bd82bd82bf8141835883798343839382cc836f838b8366835882aa0a934782c882f182c582b582e58148",
          "current_body_hex": "596f7527726520656e656d69657320776974682056616c646573200a206f6620537061696e2c2072696768743f",
          "Japanese": "あんたたち、スペインのバルデスが\n敵なんでしょ？",
          "current_English": "You're enemies with Valdes \n of Spain, right?"
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 3178,
          "current_command_offset": 2974,
          "source_offset": 3183,
          "current_offset": 2979,
          "source_record_index": 331,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 0,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "93478148814082a4815b82f18141835883798343839382cd0a837c838b8367834b838b97cc937982f0915f82c182c482a282e982a982e781630a8a6d82a982c9934782be82cb",
          "current_body_hex": "456e656d6965733f2057656c6c2c20537061696e206861732069747320657965200a206f6e20506f7274756775657365207465727269746f72792e2e2e200a20536f207965732c207765206172652e20",
          "Japanese": "敵？　うーん、スペインは\nポルトガル領土を狙っているから…\n確かに敵だね",
          "current_English": "Enemies? Well, Spain has its eye \n on Portuguese territory... \n So yes, we are. "
        },
        {
          "file_path": "/data/SC0.DK4",
          "block": 49,
          "source_command_offset": 3256,
          "current_command_offset": 3062,
          "source_offset": 3261,
          "current_offset": 3067,
          "source_record_index": 336,
          "native_command_word": 16384,
          "selector": 2,
          "slots": [],
          "source_body_hex": "82b682e182a0814182a082bd82b582bd82bf82c693af82b682b682e182c882a20a82b182f182c882c682b182eb82c5918882c182c482e98fea8d8782b682e182c882a282ed0a82a482f1814182bb82a482e682bb82a482e6",
          "current_body_hex": "5468656e20776527766520676f74207468652073616d6520656e656d7921200a204e6f20706f696e74206669676874696e672065616368206f746865722e0a205965732c207468617427732069742120",
          "Japanese": "じゃあ、あたしたちと同じじゃない\nこんなところで争ってる場合じゃないわ\nうん、そうよそうよ",
          "current_English": "Then we've got the same enemy! \n No point fighting each other.\n Yes, that's it! "
